      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "we decided to move over to our own kind of Effect Native Agent Loop to have full regency over this uh Agent Loop such that if we have complex use cases or features that we need to build, we could kind of get in we we had full control of the of the Agent Loop",
      "timestamp_sec": 360,
      "talk_slug": "agents-in-production-how-opengov-built-and-scaled-og-assist",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4uFVSLgD2Q4&t=360s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "all the cool things you get with Effect is now propagated throughout the entire Agent Loop, like the tracing, structured concurrency, the logging, everything is more fine-grained control",
      "timestamp_sec": 360,
