      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4uFVSLgD2Q4&t=360s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "since we're kind of doing dependency injection, we could pass in a different language model if we were to uh hot swap to another one",
